SUMMARY:The Best is Yet to Come! Heal Insecurities from Past Failure and S
 hame
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nThe opportunities 
 keep growing to heal permanently from the wounds of past failures that can
  make your own positive destiny seem out of reach. Negative thoughts and e
 nergy patterns will try to keep you feeling ashamed\, helpless\, and never
  good enough\, but they simply aren’t true. You have the final say in yo
 ur lifestyle. You can just get tired of feeling bad and quit the old choic
 es that kept you stuck. Keep choosing instead to be the happy healthy crea
 tor of your own life\, and you will learn the life lessons you need to thr
 ive. Join us this Sunday May 17\, 2026 for a free leading-edge talk on the
  deepest origins and highest solutions for the problems in your life\, sta
 rting with the redefining of all problems as opportunities to grow conscio
 usness. Become more aware of your higher self and soul family for the proo
 f of a future that has always loved and guided you.\n\nThey say misery lov
 es company\, but you don’t have to agree as you seek better company. The
 re are many false negative beliefs about how life works that society will 
 offer you to join in its misery. When you agree to play your dramatic part
  in the struggle then you’ll be given a busy however miserable life. Whe
 n you disagree with the suffering paradigm\, you’ll face a lot of reject
 ion and invalidation that can really hurt until you wean off that belief c
 ulture. Many spiritual people\, and visionaries in general\, feel unsuppor
 ted\, insecure\, and even persecuted by a world that doesn’t want to imp
 rove. So why not let the past go? You’re told to fight for your dream or
  die in defeat. But in truth\, the fight is the failure itself. If you rea
 lly want to set yourself free\, you must dig deeper beneath the culture of
  perpetual failure and hurt\, until you can just quietly calmly walk away 
 as a different healed person.\n\nNegative emotions like hurt\, fear\, ange
 r\, and loneliness are only negative when they stay stuck. So of course\, 
 the negative culture teaches you to stay stuck rather than heal into posit
 ive emotional states. Negative depleting energy comes from negative belief
 s that say your life is against you thus you need to fight back\, which is
  depleting of course. Positive energy comes from positive beliefs that say
  your life is helping you\, so you just need to pay more attention to feel
  inspired and great. Be mindfully guided by the Universe to learn the ways
  of energized love from your own higher self.\n\nYour higher self is the g
 reater You who has all the answers you’ll ever need to have a great life
 . If you knew that you’d always be successful forever with health and ha
 ppiness to spare\, wouldn’t you become a kinder gentler confident person
 ? Of course you would! So obviously all the combative people who pretend t
 o be so smart and powerful are really just being dumb and weak. Underneath
  the drama is the simple fact that human beings may have good intentions a
 nd then choose the wrong actions. The greatest triumph of negativity has b
 een to convince people to use more negativity to fight negativity\, which 
 only keeps people habitually stuck in more false beliefs. When you underst
 and how life really works\, then you drop false belief habits automaticall
 y. People aren’t bad after all\; it’s the beliefs that were bad. Shame
  is a lie that says you’re a broken failure. The truth is that as a cons
 ciousness seeking answers you will make mistakes\, but you’re never the 
 mistake.\n\nFor this meetup\, think about where you have felt or still fee
 l stuck and broken. Can you separate your ability to make a failure from y
 our feelings of being a failure? You see\, actually you are a success in c
 reating that failure experience. You could use your emotions to identify e
 xactly what you did and make different choices. When you end the negativit
 y cycles in your assumptions and behavior\, then you’ll see how to run y
 our life differently. In the past you got yourself into complicated indire
 ct failures that negative inner voices could shame you for. “Oh you’re
  so stupid\, bad\, wrong\, hopeless\, unliked\, unlovable\, embarrassing\,
  unfit to exist\, etc!” You have to catch these thoughts before they rui
 n your energy. You’re used to suffering the effects of negative thoughts
  unconsciously\, but you could consciously disagree when they arise to get
  a great life instead. We’ll look at strategies for doing this\, to conv
 ert negative to positive energy\, and conclude with a guided meditation to
  choose the brighter tomorrow beginning today with your soul family in you
 r own astral heaven of super happy fun energy.\n\nWelcome! Our Inner Selve
 s Mastery spiritual support group is free online every Sunday 11am-130pm E
 DT\, with the last 30 minutes for a guided meditation. If you can’t stay
  you can get the recording. You can signup here for this meeting and visit
  www.signupISM.com for all events\, newsletter\, videos\, and more.\n\nBes
 t wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nInner Selves Mastery\nspiritual teachin
 g and coaching\nquick-links at [www.signupISM.com](http://www.signupISM.co
 m)
